   5:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_can.c ****   * @brief   CAN HAL module driver.
   6:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_can.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_can.c ****   *          functionalities of the Controller Area Network (CAN) peripheral:
